<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450400" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 8 — Image inside a bulleted list item</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a section where the author has placed an &lt;img&gt; element inside an &lt;li&gt; element</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>status</keyword>
        <keyword>inside</keyword>
        <keyword>green</keyword>
        <keyword>media</keyword>
        <keyword>indicates</keyword>
        <keyword>Image</keyword>
        <indexterm>status</indexterm>
        <indexterm>inside</indexterm>
        <indexterm>green</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>
      <section>
      <p>Consider a section where the author has placed an <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> element inside an <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> element of an unordered list — for example, to show a status icon as part of a descriptive list.</p>
         
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Image inside bulleted list item</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;h2>Status Indicators&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
  &lt;li>
    The green status icon
    &lt;img src="media/green_status_icon.png" alt="Green status icon"/>
    indicates that the system is running.
  &lt;/li>
  &lt;li>
    The red status icon
    &lt;img src="media/red_status_icon.png" alt="Red status icon"/>
    indicates that an error has occurred.
  &lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;concept id="status_indicators">
  &lt;title>Status Indicators&lt;/title>
  &lt;conbody>
    &lt;ul>
      &lt;li>
        The green status icon
        &lt;image href="media/green_status_icon.png" placement="inline">
          &lt;alt>Green status icon&lt;/alt>
        &lt;/image>
        indicates that the system is running.
      &lt;/li>
      &lt;li>
        The red status icon
        &lt;image href="media/red_status_icon.png" placement="inline">
          &lt;alt>Red status icon&lt;/alt>
        &lt;/image>
        indicates that an error has occurred.
      &lt;/li>
    &lt;/ul>
  &lt;/conbody>
&lt;/concept></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p><b>Result:</b> The converter maps the <codeph>&lt;ul&gt;</codeph> to a DITA <codeph>&lt;ul&gt;</codeph> and each <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> to a DITA <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph>. Inline <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> elements inside each <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> are preserved as <codeph>&lt;image placement="inline"/&gt;</codeph> inside the corresponding <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> element.</p>
         </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
